          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "China's Moonshot AI raises $2B at $20B valuation as open-source AI demand drives $200M annual revenue",
            "articleSection": "Discovery & Research",
            "abstract": "Chinese AI lab Moonshot AI has closed a $2 billion funding round at a $20 billion valuation, reflecting surging global demand for open-source AI alternatives to US-based models. The company's annualised recurring revenue crossed $200 million in April 2026, driven by rapid growth in both paid consumer subscriptions and developer API usage. The raise positions Moonshot as one of China's highest-valued independent AI labs and underscores the commercial viability of open-weight model strategies.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/07/chinas-moonshot-ai-raises-2b-at-20b-valuation-as-demand-for-open-source-ai-skyrockets/",
